1
00:00:09,513 --> 00:00:10,683
(Penny:)It's out of order.

2
00:00:10,848 --> 00:00:15,188
(Woman:)Yes, I can read the sign.
I'm just pondering the implications.

3
00:00:16,228 --> 00:00:20,188
(Penny:)I think it implies
that the elevator doesn't work.

4
00:00:21,233 --> 00:00:23,193
(Woman:)Again, I can read the sign.

5
00:00:23,735 --> 00:00:27,075
But the sign and tape are covered
with a layer of dust which indicates...

6
00:00:27,239 --> 00:00:30,449
(Woman:)...the elevator has been nonfunctional
for an amount of time...

7
00:00:30,617 --> 00:00:33,747
(Woman:)...which suggests either a remarkable
passivity among the...

8
00:00:33,912 --> 00:00:37,082
(Woman:)...I assume 24 to 36 residents
of this building...

9
00:00:37,249 --> 00:00:41,169
(Woman:)...based on the number of mailboxes and
given typical urban population density...

10
00:00:41,336 --> 00:00:44,716
(Woman:)...or a shared delusion of functionality.

11
00:00:46,175 --> 00:00:48,555
(Penny:)You must be Leonard's mother.

12
00:00:49,928 --> 00:00:52,968
(Leonard's Mother:)Oh, I don't know if I must be, but yes.

13
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:56,100
- Uh, I'm Penny, I'm his neighbor.
- Oh, Dr. Beverly Hofstadter.

14
00:00:56,268 --> 00:00:57,768
(Penny:)Oh, nice to meet you.

15
00:00:58,187 --> 00:01:03,027
(Beverley:)Oh, you're a hand shaker. Interesting.

